    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/5bdcd382519344fd83530feeeb8aae24","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/5bdcd382519344fd83530feeeb8aae24","content":"\u003cdiv class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5 overflow-x-auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"7e9e912b-4251-4488-8636-8083113cad6d\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA TotalEnergies-led consortium is poised to harness the vast natural gas reserves discovered in the offshore Rovuma Basin, one of Africa\u0027s largest modern foreign direct investments today.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe initial phases are expected to resume this year, which include developing two onshore liquefaction trains with a combined capacity of 12.88 million tonnes per annum of LNG, with significant potential future expansion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/x1sapamr/mozambique-afungi-project.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe site of the Mozambique Liquefied Natural Gas (LNG) Project in Cabo Delgado province.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5 overflow-x-auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"7e9e912b-4251-4488-8636-8083113cad6d\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Mozambique Liquefied Natural Gas (LNG) Project is a monumental undertaking in Palma, Mozambique.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur dedicated laboratory for this project has successfully achieved ISO 17025:2017 accreditation by PJLA, an international assurance of quality for this world-class project.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe will be providing accredited testing for onsite and laboratory soil testing, concrete strength and workability testing and other material quality assurance services.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eOur Work\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith an ISO 17025:2017 accredited facility, we are set to provide all contractors on this immense project with the building confidence provided by an international quality standard.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese services will include geotechnical and quality assurance testing that focuses on earthworks, soils and concrete.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoth in-field in and in-lab testing will be available, and our Afungi team will be supported by Roadlab E Serviços Limitada, our operation in Mozambique.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eAn Accredited Facility\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhile accreditation is a routine part of our operations, this particular achievement holds special significance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLocated in a remote area of the Cabo Delgado province, the logistical hurdles of this effort were formidable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA difficult task was made more complex by a language barrier (the local language is Portuguese) and the implementation of testing standards by the American Society for Testing and Materials (ASTM).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis unique challenge and success represents another milestone in our efforts to deliver insight and testing in Africa that would inspire confidence anywhere on the planet.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/n1ahusen/mozambique-afungi-lng.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/ysyl1nif/roadlab-mozambique-team.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/ubnfbqfh/roadlab-mozambique.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eOur Technical Journey\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"td-a-rec td-a-rec-id-content_inlineleft  td_uid_12_633d70de2eeea_rand td_block_template_1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"td-visible-desktop\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"beacon_1c824f1e1b\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 0px; visibility: hidden;\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px;\" src=\"https://ads-za.privatelabel.co.za/www/delivery/lg.php?bannerid=1428\u0026amp;campaignid=218\u0026amp;zoneid=32\u0026amp;loc=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.miningmx.com%2Fnews%2Fbase-metals%2F49235-vedanta-approves-r7bn-project-to-double-up-zinc-from-gamsberg-facilities-in-northern-cape%2F\u0026amp;referer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2F\u0026amp;cb=1c824f1e1b\" alt=\"\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCongratulations to the Afungi team for their extraordinary effort and outstanding achievement.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis represents many months of dedicated work by an international group of operations, quality and administrative teams.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe are immensely proud of this milestone and grateful to every team member who contributed to this success.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cem\u003e- Janco Potgieter, Group Technical Manager\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/vwmbvrbe/janco.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eInterested in our work?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eReach out to us.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<p>Roadlab E Serviços Limitada, our operation in Mozambique, is supporting the work of globally-significant mining, engineering and construction infrastructure.</p>",
